bench/gate-recall/

# bench/dogfood — PRIVATE: live dogfooding gate-fire mining. `extract_fires.ts` itself
# is tracked, but the harvested `fires-*.jsonl` contains user-private session content
# (drafts + prior-user turns from real Claude Code conversations) and is never
# committed. A publishable distribution gets reconstructed separately via manual
# classification of a sanitized subset.
bench/dogfood/fires-*.jsonl
